### Base Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000/api/v1
@contentType = application/json

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. User Login (Customer)
# @name userLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/user/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "phone": "9390075877",
  "password": "sai@1398"
}

### Store User Access Token
@userToken = {{userLogin.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### 3. Vendor Login
# @name vendorLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/vendor/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "identifier": "sai_halls",
  "password": "Vedika@123"
}

### Store Vendor Access Token
@vendorToken = {{vendorLogin.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### 4. Smart AI Plan Calculation (Stateless)
POST {{baseUrl}}/planner
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "eventType": "wedding",
  "totalBudget": 800000,
  "guestCount": 600,
  "city": "Kadapa",
  "days": 1
}

### 5. Browse Vendors in Kadapa
GET {{baseUrl}}/vendors?city=Kadapa&kind=hall

### 6. Get Branch Details (Privacy Protected)
GET {{baseUrl}}/vendors/br_sai_classic

### 7. Calculate Pricing Quote
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/quote
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "branchId": "br_sai_classic",
  "startDate": "2026-12-15",
  "endDate": "2026-12-15",
  "slot": "full_day",
  "guests": 600
}

### 8. Create Booking (15-Minute Hold Lock)
# @name createBooking
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "branchId": "br_sai_classic",
  "eventType": "wedding",
  "startDate": "2026-12-15",
  "endDate": "2026-12-15",
  "slot": "full_day",
  "guests": 600
}

### Store Booking ID
@bookingId = {{createBooking.response.body.data.id}}

### 9. Create Payment Order
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/create-order
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "bookingId": "{{bookingId}}"
}

### 10. Confirm Payment
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "bookingId": "{{bookingId}}",
  "providerOrderId": "order_mock_123",
  "providerPaymentId": "pay_mock_123",
  "method": "upi"
}

### 11. Test Chat - Clean Message (Allowed)
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/conversations/conv_demo_1/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "body": "The function hall looks great. Is parking available for 50 cars?"
}

### 12. Test Chat - Contact Guard (Blocked: Returns 422)
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/conversations/conv_demo_1/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "body": "Please call me directly on 9849012345 to discuss discount"
}

### 13. Initiate Masked In-App Call
POST {{baseUrl}}/calls/initiate
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "conversationId": "conv_demo_1"
}

### 14. Vendor Revenue Summary & Analytics
GET {{baseUrl}}/vendor/revenue/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{vendorToken}}

### 15. Vendor 12-Month Historical Revenue Series
GET {{baseUrl}}/vendor/revenue/series?months=12
Authorization: Bearer {{vendorToken}}
